<title>USA: Town &amp; Country has Balfour sale agreement.</title>
<headline>Town &amp; Country has Balfour sale agreement.</headline>
<dateline>CHELSEA, Mass. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Town &amp; Country Corp said it has reached an agreement with Class Rings Inc for the acquisition of the L.G. Balfour division of Town &amp; Counry.</p>
<p>The company said it will receive $44 million in cash for its Balfour class ring operations. The proposed transaction is subject to financing and final approval by the Federal Trade Commission.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
